 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "CameraLogServer(): requestLog(cameraId,timestamp) queues a command; pollCommand(cameraId) removes and returns the oldest pending timestamp for that camera or -1 (non-blocking); sendLog(cameraId,timestamp,log) appends to the log queue; pollLog() removes and returns the oldest log as [cameraId,timestamp,log] or null. Concurrency is modelled as one deterministic linearized sequence of calls; thread safety is out of scope for this exact-trace contract.",
